<div class="image-container">
    <img src="~/Image/anhnhau.jpg" alt="Ảnh nhàu" class="background-image">
    <div class="text-overlay">
        <h2>Smart Meal is the perfect choice for you.</h2>
        <div class="intro">
            <div class="item">
                <img src="~/Image/mũ.png" alt="Chef Icon" class="icon">
                <p>
                    Personalized diet: We suggest meal plans tailored to your health needs, weight goals, and personal preferences.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <img src="~/Image/mũ.png" alt="Chef Icon" class="icon">
                <p>Easily track nutrition and calories: Provides detailed statistics on calories, protein, carbs, fat, etc., helping you control your diet scientifically.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <img src="~/Image/mũ.png" alt="Chef Icon" class="icon">
                <p>Automated meal planning: Helps you schedule daily/weekly/monthly meals, saving you time thinking about and shopping for ingredients.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<section class="dinner-strategy">
    <div class="content">
        <h2>The Importance of a Nutritious Meal</h2>
        <p>
            A nutritious meal not only provides energy for the body but also plays a crucial role in maintaining health, improving mood, and strengthening the immune system. When consuming sufficient protein, vitamins, minerals, and fiber, the body can function more efficiently, reducing the risk of disease and helping maintain a healthy weight.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="~/Image/Nấu ăn.png" alt="Woman cooking">
    </div>
</section>
<section class="dinner-strategy">
    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="~/Image/eatplan.jpg" alt="Eat Plan">
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Automated meal plan</h2>
        <p>
            Automated meal planning offers many important benefits, improving both health and daily life. It saves considerable time, as users no longer need to think about what to eat each day. The automated system will suggest menus based on nutritional needs, personal preferences, and budget, making shopping and preparation quicker and easier.

            Automated meal planning also helps balance nutrition, ensuring adequate intake of all essential food groups. This is a useful solution for improving health and saving time.
        </p>
    </div>

</section>



<!-- CTA -->
<div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
    <a href="#"
       class="bg-[#C4A46B] px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-white hover:bg-[#A89F98] text-lg font-semibold">
        Learn more
    </a>
</div>



<script>
    function toggleMenu() {
        var menu = document.getElementById("menu");
        menu.classList.toggle("hidden");
    }
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
        const scrollContainer = document.querySelector(".scroll-content");
        let originalContent = scrollContainer.innerHTML;
        scrollContainer.innerHTML += originalContent;

        let scrollSpeed = 0.1;
        let scrollPosition = 0;

        function scrollLoop() {
            scrollPosition -= scrollSpeed;
            if (Math.abs(scrollPosition) >= scrollContainer.scrollWidth / 2) {
                scrollPosition = 0;
            }
            scrollContainer.style.transform = `translateX(${scrollPosition}px)`;
        }

        setInterval(scrollLoop, 30);
    });
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
        const images = document.querySelectorAll(".hero-image-wrapper img");
        let index = 0;

        function changeImage() {
            images.forEach((img, i) => {
                img.classList.remove("active");
                if (i === index) img.classList.add("active");
            });

            index = (index + 1) % images.length;
        }

        let interval = setInterval(changeImage, 2000); // Tự động đổi ảnh sau 2s

        document.querySelector(".hero-image-wrapper").addEventListener("mouseenter", function () {
            changeImage();
        });

        document.querySelector(".hero-image-wrapper").addEventListener("mouseleave", function () {
            clearInterval(interval);
            interval = setInterval(changeImage, 3000);
        });
    });

</script>
